@startuml
title Rubber tapping — completion-outbox
actor Worker
participant API
participant TappingService
database PostgreSQL
participant OutboxDispatcher
queue RabbitMQ
Worker -> API : complete(version,actualTreeCount,notes) + JWT
API -> TappingService : validate DTO / authorize object
TappingService -> PostgreSQL : load assignment + execution
TappingService -> TappingService : state + actual-tree invariants
TappingService -> PostgreSQL : conditional version update
TappingService -> PostgreSQL : execution completion + outbox insert
TappingService -> PostgreSQL : commit
TappingService --> Worker : immutable completed view
OutboxDispatcher -> PostgreSQL : locked committed due events
OutboxDispatcher -> RabbitMQ : persistent message / stable eventId
RabbitMQ --> OutboxDispatcher : confirm + mandatory return check
alt confirmed and routed
 OutboxDispatcher -> PostgreSQL : mark PUBLISHED / commit
else failure
 OutboxDispatcher -> PostgreSQL : backoff / PENDING or FAILED / commit
end
@enduml
